    "offline": "On form submission (a page with only an HTML field) is followed by Form node pages: Research Request (the research prompt; the depth and breadth inputs that the page's HTML adds as field-1 and field-2, read by Set Variables as input-depth and input-breadth; the cost acknowledgement, a multiselect whose label is an expression), one Ask Clarity Questions page per model-written question (at most 3 by the prompt; the label is the question, so the answer goes by position), then Confirmation. trigger.formPages (P20, added for PROPOSALS P49) answers them in order, each when n8n waits for a page: with fewer than 3 questions a spare answer goes to the next waiting page (Confirmation, an HTML-only page) and later entries go to whatever waits next or are skipped once the execution ends; with canned models the question list is empty and the run ends after Research Request. The research runs in child executions of this workflow (Initiate DeepResearch, waitForSubWorkflow false, then Generate Learnings / Generate Report through the DeepResearch Subworkflow trigger), started before Confirmation and awaited by the n8n side (P20), so the pages after the questions do not change any effect. The same person answers the pages in every variant; the variants differ in what Notion and Apify return. The Claude side has no form pages (forms that wait are out of scope v1)"
